KG42.register("clusters-bb38eabd81859282b4517f7f",{"id":"35-microgrid_pool_strategy::v142-d-K001","paper":"35-microgrid_pool_strategy","label":"Distribution market operation responsibilities, free participation, and price-maker risk bearing","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-K001","label":"Distribution market operation responsibilities, free participation, and price-maker risk bearing","market_meaning":"Under the distribution-system power pool regulations, the DSO is responsible for interaction between the system and participants, the DMO is responsible for market regulation and promoting competitive access, and microgrids and distributed generators receive guarantees of free participation; price-making microgrids bear the corresponding risk when price-uncertainty risk occurs.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["DEM"],"process_stages":["participation","coordination"],"scope_disposition":"conditional","scope_explanation":"The free-participation guarantee applies to microgrids and distributed generators; the risk-bearing provision applies only to price-making microgrids that affect market prices. The shared operation node is an abstraction in the frozen framework and does not mean that the DSO and DMO are the same institution.","assembly_status":"assembled","boundary_rationale":"Operational responsibilities, access implementation, and participants' rights and obligations jointly constitute participation rules with independent institutional significance. This cluster is limited to qualitative institutional arrangements; bidding algorithms, clearing optimization, and exchange feasibility are retained separately.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R001","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"This provides the institutional provisions by which the DMO promotes competitive access and the power pool guarantees free participation."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R006","ownership":"primary","role":"support","rationale":"This clarifies the DSO interaction responsibilities and DMO market-regulation responsibilities involved in implementing the participation regime."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R009","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"This supplements the scope of participating entities and the conditional risk-bearing obligation of price-making microgrids."}],"connections":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-CN01","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R006","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C002"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E05"],"rationale":"The same paragraph attributes both market regulation and the promotion of competitive access to the DMO, so the responsibility description and the access activity are complementary; here only an inter-chain assembly relationship is established."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K001-CN02","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R009","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C002"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E07"],"rationale":"The two chains express the same free-participation arrangement from the perspectives of institutional guarantee and participating entities respectively, and the applicable entities are consistent; the risk provision separately retains its price-maker condition."}],"object_mappings":[{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K001-OM01","kind":"same_node","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::V::coordination.local_operator","v141-c-R006::V::coordination.local_operator"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R006::V::coordination.local_operator","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E05"],"rationale":"Both places reference the same frozen operational coordination node, and R006 is selected as the display entry; the different responsibilities of the DSO and DMO are still expressed separately by the respective original constraints, and this is not taken to establish that they have the same institutional identity."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K001-OM02","kind":"same_expression","member_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C002","v141-c-R009::phi::v141-c-R009-C001"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E07"],"rationale":"The two frozen statements restate the free-participation guarantee for the same entities; R009 explicitly retains the context of bid processing and evaluation criteria, so they are displayed in association with their respective qualifications retained and are not counted as two independent guarantees."}],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-K001-G01","category":"ontology_extension","description":"The generic operation node does not distinguish the responsibilities of the DSO, DNO, and DMO, and the generic participation node does not fully express the price-making capability of microgrids. The related proposals v141-b-g01-P02 and v141-b-g01-P03 remain unapproved.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R001","v141-c-R006","v141-c-R009"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R001::V::coordination.local_operator","v141-c-R006::V::coordination.local_operator","v141-c-R009::V::participation.prosumer"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E05","v141-b-g01-E07","v141-b-g02-E01"],"proposal_ids":["v141-b-g01-P02","v141-b-g01-P03"],"required_work":"Manually check the expression boundaries of institutional responsibilities and price-maker semantics, and then decide whether to adopt the proposals; keep the existing nodes and conditional provisions unchanged."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K001-G02","category":"unverified_source","description":"The B evidence cited by this cluster is currently all unverified; experimental candidate permission does not mean that the transcription is correct or that the scientific conclusions have undergone independent review.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R001","v141-c-R006","v141-c-R009"],"object_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E05","v141-b-g01-E07","v141-b-g02-E01"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"The sources and this cluster's responsibilities, entities, and risk-applicability conditions are to be manually checked; in this round, no B audit, C2 independent review, or Agent E was performed."}]},"rule_refs":["35-microgrid_pool_strategy::v141-c-R001","35-microgrid_pool_strategy::v141-c-R006","35-microgrid_pool_strategy::v141-c-R009"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-2093350950f0291a","COMP-3404194690ffc9b6","COMP-3514ee42342816d1"]});
